        <mxCell id="note-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;TriviaQuestion parent rule&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;spot_id, icon_id and ar_target_id are all nullable. Business logic expects exactly one parent per question, but the XOR is &lt;u&gt;not&lt;/u&gt; enforced by the database. correct_index is stored server-side." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="400" x="1660" y="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note-2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;FK delete behavior&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CASCADE by default.&lt;br&gt;SET NULL: ARTarget.spot, TriviaQuestion.generated_by / reviewed_by, Transaction.bundle.&lt;br&gt;Wallet is 1:1 and may not exist until first use." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="400" x="1660" y="610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Underlined&lt;/u&gt; = primary key&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Italic FK &amp;rarr;&lt;/i&gt; = foreign key (target shown)&lt;br&gt;(UQ) = unique &amp;middot; ? = nullable&lt;br&gt;Crow&amp;rsquo;s foot: || exactly one &amp;middot; o| zero or one &amp;middot; o{ zero or many&lt;br&gt;Blue = accounts &amp;middot; Green = qr_scan &amp;middot; Orange = promotions&lt;br&gt;Standalone entities: MilestoneBadge, AppSetting&lt;br&gt;CustomUser logs in with email (no username column)." vertex="1">
